  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I am no longer able to download any new worlds. My internet speed is 12Mbps down, 1Mbps up, and 40ms ping according to http://speedtest.net/. I do not appear to be having any issues with other games, and I have not had any issues with this game prior to the latest update.\n\nThe game is now unplayable for me. Is there any way to fix this?\n\nEDIT:\nForgot to include *which* version/build this is. Just in case:\nVRChat 2019.2.2, build number 772\n\nHere's a video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qIwM_6HqQJk",
